Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:44:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Floating entities move portal-aware (position, velocity,
 kill path)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PortalGeometry::portal_aware_move traverses portals for movers the way
ray_to_naive_line_segments does for rays — exact crossings, no epsilon,
16-crossing guard — returning end position, accumulated rotation, and
traveled sub-paths. The slide_floating_entity_with_portal_awareness funnel
now uses it (rotating velocity at crossings), tick_death_cubes routes
through the funnel and kills along each sub-path, and conveyor/floor-arrow
pushes inherit portal awareness. Un-ignores
test_hunter_drone_moves_through_portal.
